---
layout: layouts/base.njk
roomPage: study
title: 每月進度
description: 菜菜一年學習計畫的逐月安排，每條主線每個月要做的事。
permalink: /plan/monthly/
---
<article class="plan" data-plan data-start="{{ plan.start }}" data-entry="{{ plan.entry }}">
  <h1 class="page-title">每月進度</h1>
  <p class="page-sub">這個月會自動展開。<a href="/plan/">回到學習計畫</a></p>

  <div class="months">
    {%- for m in plan.months %}
    <details class="month" data-month="{{ m.month }}">
      <summary>
        <span class="month-name">{{ m.month | replace("/", " 年 ") | replace(" 年 0", " 年 ") }} 月</span>
        <span class="month-meta">{{ m.weeks }}<span class="phase-id tl-{{ m.phase | lower }}">{{ m.phase }}</span></span>
        <span class="month-now" hidden>本月</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="month-body">
        {%- if m.check.length %}
        <p class="month-check"><strong>本月驗收</strong>{{ m.check | join("；") }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- for t in m.topics %}
        <section class="month-topic">
          <h3>{{ t.name }}</h3>
          <ul>{% for it in t.items %}<li>{{ it }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        </section>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </details>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</article>
